AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000318> "Raman spectroscopic detection of haemoproteins in the eluate from high-performance liquid chromatography. J Chromatogr. 1983 Jan 7;254:285-8. PMID: 6298263"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000318> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120>)
