AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000318> "need to add restriction to indicate: has_part some (material entity has_role mobile phase)
need to add mobile phase as role"@en)
