# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000371> (heat function)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000371> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000371> "A heat function is a function that increases the internal kinetic energy of a material"@en)
