EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000792> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000417> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0200188>))
