AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0200167> "data normalization objective"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0200167> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0200166>)

