AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0200172> "A k-means clustering which has partitioning objective is a data transformation in which the input data is partitioned into k output sets."@en)
